{
 "_doc": "Forest set pieces, round 4 (ADR-0053): the Dunmore Timber truck depot, a logging company's truck shop deep in the timber by a haul road. Route: in off the logging road past Ray's loaded truck on the weighbridge -> the scale house (weigh tickets, the Cordon's road closure order) -> the fuel island -> the shop's side door, bolted -> three bay doors chained, one leaf of bay 2 torn off -> the bays (a log truck up on the lift) -> down the ladder into the inspection pit (jaws in the muck) -> Hank's key ring at the far end (taking it, or the jaws, wakes the mechanics) -> climb out -> the parts room's padlock (the key ring) and a can chime -> the office key on the parts counter -> the welding shop -> stairs up to the break room (loose boards wake the drivers, as does opening the office) -> the dispatch office (deadbolt, the office key; Vera, guardian; the loot) -> back down -> draw the side door's bolt. Props: props/wild4_depot.json.",
